1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,814
Most memecoins rug to zero, with nothing underneath.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,809
And they're split across chains.

3
00:00:05,829 --> 00:00:07,350
Bridge, new wallet, gas.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,530
Basketcase. Buy the meme. Keep the index.

5
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:13,324
Every coin holds a basket of real assets.

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,029
Each $DEGEN is backed by $1.30 in that basket.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,249
Assets from six chains, held in one vault on NEAR Intents.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,239
Fees and burns raise the floor.

9
00:00:23,259 --> 00:00:24,760
It's never a guarantee.

10
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,021
Anyone can launch one.

11
00:00:26,041 --> 00:00:28,348
Pick up to nine assets from any chain.

12
00:00:28,368 --> 00:00:32,877
Bitcoin, Solana, NVIDIA stock, even NEAR memes from meme.cooking.

13
00:00:32,897 --> 00:00:34,897
The coin holds them all in one vault.

14
00:00:36,463 --> 00:00:38,102
Holders vote on the basket.

15
00:00:38,122 --> 00:00:41,143
Burn tokens to challenge an asset, or defend it.

16
00:00:41,163 --> 00:00:44,385
A winning challenge opens an auction that swaps it out.

17
00:00:44,613 --> 00:00:47,323
Pay with USDC from Base or Solana.

18
00:00:48,713 --> 00:00:50,923
No bridge, no new wallet, no NEAR gas.

19
00:00:50,943 --> 00:00:51,914
You just sign.

20
00:00:52,313 --> 00:00:54,426
The coins land under your own address.

21
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:56,773
Or buy right inside your X feed.

22
00:00:56,793 --> 00:01:00,595
One tap to buy, one more to sell, without leaving the post.

23
00:01:03,713 --> 00:01:07,340
When a coin graduates, it becomes an index, listed on Rhea.

24
00:01:07,913 --> 00:01:10,324
Basketcase. Built on NEAR Intents.

